flowchart TD
    User[User] --> App[TaskFlow React Application]

    App --> Router[React Router]
    App --> Features[Feature Pages and Components]
    App --> Shared[Reusable Layout and UI]

    Features --> API[Centralized API Client]
    API --> Mapping[camelCase or snake_case Mapping]
    API --> MSW[MSW Mock API]

    MSW --> Auth[Authentication Handlers]
    MSW --> Projects[Projects Handlers]
    MSW --> Tasks[Tasks Handlers]

    Auth --> Data[(In-Memory Mock Data)]
    Projects --> Data
    Tasks --> Data